Description: local conversational Linux agent (public alpha)
 Persistent local conversations and tasks, rootless isolated execution,
 controlled publication and independent result checking. A compatible local
 llama.cpp server and separately obtained GGUF are required. No model weights
 or third-party inference binaries are included. No services are auto-enabled.
